    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Example below: I want to select only 2 lines with \\<p> tags when the cursor is somewhere on \\<div> or \\</div>\r\n```html\r\n<div>\r\n  <p>This is some paragraph.</p>\r\n  <p>And this is other paragraph.</p>\r\n</div>",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Example below: I want to select only 2 lines with &lt;p&gt; tags when the cursor is somewhere on &lt;div&gt; or &lt;/div&gt;</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-text-html-basic notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&lt;div&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;This is some paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;And this is other paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">p</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>This is some paragraph.<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">p</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">p</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>And this is other paragraph.<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">p</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span></pre></div>",
    "bodyText": "Example below: I want to select only 2 lines with <p> tags when the cursor is somewhere on <div> or </div>\n<div>\n  <p>This is some paragraph.</p>\n  <p>And this is other paragraph.</p>\n</div>",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
