    "comment_count": 2,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "You can override [built-in `t` textobject](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/lua/mini/ai.lua#L1182) by adding `%s*` outside of capture groups. Like so:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire('mini.ai').setup({\r\n  custom_textobjects = {\r\n    t = { '<(%w-)%f[^<%w][^<>]->.-</%1>', '^<.->%s*().*()%s*</[^/]->$' },\r\n  }\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen use linewise selection with `Vit`. Depending on your search method, you might need to increase selection again with `it`.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">You can override <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/lua/mini/ai.lua#L1182\">built-in <code class=\"notranslate\">t</code> textobject</a> by adding <code class=\"notranslate\">%s*</code> outside of capture groups. Like so:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"require('mini.ai').setup({\n  custom_textobjects = {\n    t = { '&lt;(%w-)%f[^&lt;%w][^&lt;&gt;]-&gt;.-&lt;/%1&gt;', '^&lt;.-&gt;%s*().*()%s*&lt;/[^/]-&gt;$' },\n  }\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>mini.ai<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>({\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">custom_textobjects</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">t</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;(%w-)%f[^&lt;%w][^&lt;&gt;]-&gt;.-&lt;/%1&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>^&lt;.-&gt;%s*().*()%s*&lt;/[^/]-&gt;$<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n  }\n})</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Then use linewise selection with <code class=\"notranslate\">Vit</code>. Depending on your search method, you might need to increase selection again with <code class=\"notranslate\">it</code>.</p>",
            "bodyText": "You can override built-in t textobject by adding %s* outside of capture groups. Like so:\nrequire('mini.ai').setup({\n  custom_textobjects = {\n    t = { '<(%w-)%f[^<%w][^<>]->.-</%1>', '^<.->%s*().*()%s*</[^/]->$' },\n  }\n})\nThen use linewise selection with Vit. Depending on your search method, you might need to increase selection again with it.",
